  - expo-sqlite URI-decodes db names (toUri().path): literal %40/%2F must be double-encoded (%->%25) or a wrong nested file opens (seen as tables=[]).
  - expo-file-system cannot list <pkg>/databases (permission gate: only filesDir/cacheDir) - expo-sqlite used instead.
  - In-app repair (historyRepair.js): strips heatmap (+probabilities/individual if >1.5MB), UPDATEs row. Result: 43 entries, 3946944 -> 28571 bytes. useHistory: load-fail -> repair -> retry; storageBlocked guard (addEntry returns null, save skipped, existing data protected). DiagnoseScreen handleSave no longer stores heatmap.
  - False alarm 02:12: "load failed" lines were pre-00:08:44 iterations (metro log has no timestamps); start.log proves zero history events after the 00:08:44 repair success.
  DRIVER (all fixed, full cycle 09:26-09:31 re-validated: 4/4 models ok, ui==api, saved=True x4, no menu/timeout failures):
  - Select-Model: stale chip bounds after async layout shifts -> re-dump + re-acquire bounds before every tap; wrong-tab guard (BACK key with closed menu pops Diagnose->History tab) -> tap Diagnose tab to recover; verify label change via selver dump.
